      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I have been bad about posting things, sorry about that. \nFirst off, the tape release was one of the biggest hurdles from the first run, so this needed to be perfect. \nIt's taken way more revisions than I would like to admit to get it perfect. There's a ton going on in a very small space. \nI showed a bit about the clamp/stretcher before, but here's another shot. I also have a joystick wired in that helps with interfacing and debugging.  \nThings should start moving a lot faster now that's behind me.",
