    {
      "id": "1549677343797420033",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-16T07:04:30.374+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Yep, the tape is sucked down with a vacuum just like the previous version and modeled after the commercial machine i found a while back. \nNo, all the pins go up at once, that's why we were asking about packing in the lower left corner. Now that i have played ( a lot ) could probably feel comfortable designing something with more fidelity, but would probably no longer use steppers. Or at least steppers as the driver. \nYep, those are uv leds. 365nm. There isn't any extra space so 2 were needed and one will have to be used depending on the quadrant.",
      "author": {
        "id": "756011607603019777",
        "name": "anfroholic",
